  "segments" : [
    {
      "end" : 30.15999984741211,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 29.8799991607666,
      "text" : "Yes."
    },
    {
      "end" : 34.58000183105469,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 33.73999786376953,
      "text" : "Yes."
    },
    {
      "end" : 40.44000244140625,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 39.63999938964844,
      "text" : "What's there?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 90,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 67.5,
      "text" : "Hello everybody, I'm Sarah, the project manager, and this is our first meeting."
    },
    {
      "end" : 157.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 149,
      "text" : "work. What needs need to be fulfilled by the product, what effect the product has to have, and how it's"
    },
    {
      "end" : 177.8800048828125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 170.3800048828125,
      "text" : "Okay, we're going to practice with the pens and draw our favourite animal on the whiteboard."
    },
    {
      "end" : 183.4199981689453,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 180,
      "text" : "and some of the characteristics of that third one."
    },
    {
      "end" : 182.02000427246094,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 180.02000427246094,
      "text" : "And we'll have the same."
    },
    {
      "end" : 314.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 291.70001220703125,
      "text" : "Maybe you can guess what I'm going to make."
    },
    {
      "end" : 316.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 315.20001220703125,
      "text" : "So..."
    },
    {
      "end" : 317.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 316.20001220703125,
      "text" : "It's sitting."
    },
    {
      "end" : 318.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 317.20001220703125,
      "text" : "It's sitting."
    },
    {
      "end" : 320.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 319.20001220703125,
      "text" : "Okay."
    },
    {
      "end" : 321.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 320.20001220703125,
      "text" : "I see it as one thing."
    },
    {
      "end" : 323.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 321.20001220703125,
      "text" : "It's very supportive."
    },
    {
      "end" : 328.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 327.20001220703125,
      "text" : "It can be your best friend."
    },
    {
      "end" : 358.20001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 356.3800048828125,
      "text" : "Please leave me a space at the bottom."
    },
    {
      "end" : 385.70001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 380.70001220703125,
      "text" : "change what it was originally, because that looks like a beak."
    },
    {
      "end" : 397.70001220703125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 395.70001220703125,
      "text" : "It can be a crocodile."
    },
    {
      "end" : 402,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 397.70001220703125,
      "text" : "But it was, it was, it was an, firstly, it was an attempt at T-Rex."
    },
    {
      "end" : 406,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 402,
      "text" : "and then it sort of changed into a pelican, but it can be perfect."
    },
    {
      "end" : 404.1000061035156,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 402.05999755859375,
      "text" : "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "end" : 424.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 421,
      "text" : "Yeah, and I'll have to think on the spot on."
    },
    {
      "end" : 440.8999938964844,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 438.8999938964844,
      "text" : "Yeah, that's fine, I think."
    },
    {
      "end" : 495,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 484.5,
      "text" : "It's not a vampire, is it?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 501.4200134277344,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 500.5199890136719,
      "text" : "It's meant to be an eagle."
    },
    {
      "end" : 503.4800109863281,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 501.82000732421875,
      "text" : "Right, not a seagull."
    },
    {
      "end" : 506.5799865722656,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 505.29998779296875,
      "text" : "It could have been a seagull."
    },
    {
      "end" : 512.739990234375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 511.5199890136719,
      "text" : "I think they're all so independent."
    },
    {
      "end" : 522.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 520.5,
      "text" : "They're independent."
    },
    {
      "end" : 526.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 525.5,
      "text" : "Eagle."
    },
    {
      "end" : 528.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 526.5,
      "text" : "Oh, right."
    },
    {
      "end" : 531.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 528.5,
      "text" : "I'll say they're quite free-spirited."
    },
    {
      "end" : 574.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 571.5,
      "text" : "that is in pounds at all."
    },
    {
      "end" : 577.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_1",
      "start" : 576.5,
      "text" : "So that..."
    },
    {
      "end" : 592,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 591,
      "text" : "I think so, I think so."
    },
    {
      "end" : 601,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 596,
      "text" : "Having said that, if you want to get one of those, the ones on the market at the moment,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 609.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 608.5,
      "text" : "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "end" : 661.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 654.5,
      "text" : "Yes, yes. I don't think it's a case of worrying about different languages and things like that,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 706.1799926757812,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 705.280029296875,
      "text" : "- Use all the ones--"
    },
    {
      "end" : 737.1599731445312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 735.0399780273438,
      "text" : "Yeah, that's the main stuff anyway."
    },
    {
      "end" : 739.5599975585938,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 737.1599731445312,
      "text" : "I mean, and you don't want to,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 742.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 739.6199951171875,
      "text" : "I hate looking at a control,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 747.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 742.5,
      "text" : "and seeing a million tiny little buttons with tiny little words saying what they all do and"
    },
    {
      "end" : 855,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 852.5,
      "text" : "doing. Because I mean menus on a different way of thinking,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 857.02001953125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 855.02001953125,
      "text" : "you know, like, you know, you know, like, you know, you can't be a little bit of a lot of"
    },
    {
      "end" : 877.5,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 868.4600219726562,
      "text" : "of got a Windows-based running system. I find it really confusing. I kept getting lost. I've"
    },
    {
      "end" : 879.52001953125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 877.52001953125,
      "text" : "not gotten lost in it. I don't know how many phones are. I don't know how many phones are."
    },
    {
      "end" : 893.6799926757812,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 885.1199951171875,
      "text" : "Yeah, I don't know how for €25 or €12.50 how much of an excellent screen you could get."
    },
    {
      "end" : 971.7000122070312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_3",
      "start" : 968.7000122070312,
      "text" : "Yeah, sorry, I'm treading on your territory."
    },
    {
      "end" : 975.7000122070312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 971.7000122070312,
      "text" : "Right, okay, we've got half an hour before the next meeting,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 979.7000122070312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 975.7000122070312,
      "text" : "so we're all gonna go off and do our individual things."
    },
    {
      "end" : 982.7000122070312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 979.7000122070312,
      "text" : "I think that's probably about it,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 986.7000122070312,
      "speaker" : "speaker_0",
      "start" : 984.7000122070312,
      "text" : "and I'll get to do another."
    },
    {
      "end" : 994.5999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 989.4599609375,
      "text" : "- Just a quick thing about what you were saying about the,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 996.8399658203125,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 994.5999755859375,
      "text" : "it doesn't need to be fashionable,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 1000.239990234375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 996.8399658203125,
      "text" : "so I had a quick look at the company website,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 1005.239990234375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 1000.239990234375,
      "text" : "and it's like the, we put the fashion into electronics."
    },
    {
      "end" : 1009.199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 1005.239990234375,
      "text" : "So I think the whole design thing might be quite,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 1010.0999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 1009.199951171875,
      "text" : "- Sure."
    },
    {
      "end" : 1014.0999755859375,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 1010.0999755859375,
      "text" : "You can still have plastic and it looks quite good."
    },
    {
      "end" : 1012.1199951171875,
      "speaker" : "speaker_2",
      "start" : 1010.1199951171875,
      "text" : "- I mean you don't, you don't, you know,"
    }
